    "created_at": "2018-06-07T19:12:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-07T19:12:20Z",
    "body": "Or, sorry, you are correct. I missed the parser-inserted check in the first clause of Step 26.\r\n\r\nStill, (2) is the current behavior of Chromium, because for module scripts Chromium considers the script is ready always asynchronously.",
