    "updated_at": "2023-07-14T20:40:15Z",
    "body": "The spec now explicitly does (2), probably since https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8253 that made the loading process consistently await the \"loadingPromise\" returned by ECMA-262's LoadRequestedModules() regardless of the number of dependencies.",
